# Product card marked UI (SkyBuy common design)

## Grid / rail / card rows

Use `apps/frontstore/src/components/storefront/product/product-grid-card.tsx`.

Do **not** invent a one-off product card layout for homepage, China browse, More to love, category rails, search grids, etc.

## List views (e.g. Related Products sidebar)

Compact rows must still include the **same marked meta**:

1. **Wishlist** — heart on thumbnail top-right
2. **Price (left) + ★ rating (right)**
3. **SOLD** + **Repurchase** chips

Reuse formatters from `product-card-info.tsx` and `ProductWishlistButton` / seed helpers from `product-grid-card.tsx`. See `product-sidebar.tsx`.

## Required marked UI

1. **Wishlist** — heart overlay on image top-right
2. **Price (left) + ★ rating (right)** on one row
3. **SOLD** + **Repurchase** chips under the title

Supporting pieces:

- `product-grid-card.tsx` — canonical grid card
- `product-card-image.tsx` — square thumbnail
- `product-card-info.tsx` — price / rating / title / chips
- `product-wishlist-button.tsx` — heart overlay

## Exceptions

- CMS category catalog cards (`catalog-view.tsx`) may keep CMS Buy now / compare toggles until migrated.
- PDP gallery / purchase panel are not product cards.

## When adding a new product surface

- Grid → `ProductGridCard`
- List → same marked fields as sidebar (wishlist + price/rating + SOLD/Repurchase)
